{"resourceIdentifier":"2508","resourceName":"UNITOR REDD+ PROJECT","description":"The UNITOR REDD+ PROJECT is located in Lábrea, Amazonas State, Brazil, which is the municipality with the fourth highest aggregate deforestation rate in Brazil between 2008 and 2020, according to PRODES data1. Municipal deforestation rates have risen year on year, from 3.8% in 2017 to 5.3% in 2020, making it a priority area for forest conservation worldwide. A consortium of 15 neighbouring properties comprises the Unitor REDD+ Project, summing to 99,035.20 ha of forest area, who have come together to develop forest carbon activities under the guidance, example and inspiration of the nearby Fortaleza Ituxi REDD Project.","location":{"latitude":-9.131670,"longitude":-66.137970},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-05-27","endExclusive":"2021-06-27","endInclusive":"2021-06-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2508"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Amazonas"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"On Hold - see notification letter"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2508"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2508"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"522923"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":241163}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"94270 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","